  "details": "Description\n\nWhen the game lags too much, all audio stops working and the mic stops working as well. Another thing is all animations stop working.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nGoing into a large server, turning on all avatars (or just getting youself to lag a bunch). This should cause the audio to stop worksing.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Audio\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.2-1949-1134d5e8be-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-17_18-58-12.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_a28b5915-a7a3-4774-8376-8be5feeab2c4/1/file)",
